---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy – Midjourney Prompt Generator" description="Privacy Policy for Midjourney Prompt Generator">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 space-y-8 text-[#1a1a1a]">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#6b6559]">Last updated: May 10, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">1. Who We Are</h2>
      <p class="text-[#4a4540] leading-relaxed">Midjourney Prompt Generator is operated by Pazaruvai Umno Ltd., registered in Bulgaria. Contact: <a href="mailto:info@midjourney-prompt-generator.eu" class="text-[#f0b429] hover:underline">info@midjourney-prompt-generator.eu</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">2. Data We Collect</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-[#4a4540] leading-relaxed">
        <li><strong>Account data</strong> — email address and name when you sign in via Google or Discord.</li>
        <li><strong>Usage data</strong> — prompts you generate, credit consumption, and session timestamps.</li>
        <li><strong>Billing data</strong> — payment method and billing address, processed and stored by Stripe. We never see your full card number.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics</strong> — page views and events via Google Analytics (anonymised IP).</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-[#4a4540] leading-relaxed">
        <li>To provide and improve the Service.</li>
        <li>To manage your subscription and enforce credit limits.</li>
        <li>To send transactional emails (receipts, subscription confirmations).</li>
        <li>To detect abuse and enforce our Terms of Service.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p class="text-[#4a4540] leading-relaxed">We share data with the following processors:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-[#4a4540] leading-relaxed">
        <li><strong>Supabase</strong> — database and authentication (EU region).</li>
        <li><strong>Stripe</strong> — payment processing.</li>
        <li><strong>OpenAI</strong> — prompt generation. Prompts you submit are sent to OpenAI's API; see <a href="https://openai.com/policies/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-[#f0b429] hover:underline">OpenAI's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — anonymised usage analytics.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">5. Cookies</h2>
      <p class="text-[#4a4540] leading-relaxed">We use essential cookies for authentication and Google Analytics cookies for usage measurement. You can disable analytics cookies in your browser settings.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">6. Data Retention</h2>
      <p class="text-[#4a4540] leading-relaxed">We retain your account data for as long as your account is active. You may request deletion at any time by emailing us. Billing records are retained for 7 years as required by Bulgarian tax law.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">7. Your GDPR Rights</h2>
      <p class="text-[#4a4540] leading-relaxed">As an EU resident you have the right to access, correct, export, or delete your personal data. To exercise these rights, email <a href="mailto:info@midjourney-prompt-generator.eu" class="text-[#f0b429] hover:underline">info@midjourney-prompt-generator.eu</a>. We will respond within 30 days.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p class="text-[#4a4540] leading-relaxed">We may update this Policy from time to time. The "last updated" date at the top will reflect any changes. Continued use of the Service after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
